<title>MALI: Arms dump blast kills six in Mali.</title>
<headline>Arms dump blast kills six in Mali.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An explosion in the arms dump at Mali's biggest military camp has killed six people and wounded a further 11, according to the armed forces ministry.</p>
<p>The cause of Wednesday's blast at the Soundiat Keita camp, 15 km (nine miles) north of the capital Bamako, was not immediately clear, a ministry statement said.</p>
<p>An investigation has been launched. Civilians living nearby evacuated their homes.</p>
